<title>USA: Family Dollar Feb same-store sales rises.</title>
<headline>Family Dollar Feb same-store sales rises.</headline>
<dateline>MATTHEWS, N.C. 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Percent change</p>
<p>		    1997	 1996	     Total     Same-Store</p>
<p>Month	     $141.8     $123.1     +15.2	 +9.3</p>
<p>Year-to-date    $985.1     $844.4     +16.7	+10.0</p>
<p>NOTE: Figures in millions except percentage.</p>
<p>    Month is	 28 days ended	  February 28.</p>
<p>    Full company name is     Family Dollar Stores Inc</p>
<p>The sales gains were achieved despite the fact that there were 28 days in February 1997 and 29 days in February 1996.</p>
</text>
